# Home-Style Tiffin Delivery in Pune

Vegetarian lunch with 4 rotis, sabzi, dal, rice & Sunday sweet

Made in Baner kitchen since 2019

**[Start Weekly Plan on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919876543210)**

## About Our Service

Annapurna Tiffins cooks home-style vegetarian tiffins in a kitchen in Baner, Pune. We deliver to Baner, Aundh, Balewadi and Pashan. Lunch reaches your door between 12:00 and 1:00 pm, with orders for the next day closing at 8 pm. Try our weekly plan for just Rs 780.

## What's in Your Tiffin

- **Daily Variety**: Menu changes every day and is posted on WhatsApp at 9 pm
- **Wholesome Ingredients**: Each tiffin has 4 rotis, one dry sabzi, one dal or curry, rice and a sweet on Sundays only
- **Pure Cooking**: We use cold-pressed groundnut oil and no ajinomoto

## Serving Pune Since 2019

- **240** tiffins delivered daily
- **6** customers when we started
- **780** ₹ for weekly plan (6 lunches)

## Ready for Homemade Lunch?

Start your weekly plan today

**[Start Weekly Plan on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919876543210)**
