# Tiffin Contents

With 4 rotis, sabzi, dal, rice and Sunday sweet

Menu changes every day, posted on WhatsApp at 9 pm

**[Start Weekly Plan on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919876543210)**

## Our Daily Tiffin

Each Annapurna Tiffin contains 4 rotis, one dry sabzi, one dal or curry, rice and a sweet on Sundays only. We use cold-pressed groundnut oil and never add ajinomoto. The menu varies daily to provide balanced, home-style nutrition. Lunch reaches you between 12:00 and 1:00 pm.

## What Makes Our Tiffins Special

