Savita Joshi started Annapurna Tiffins in 2019 with just 6 customers in Baner, Pune. Today, we proudly send out about 240 tiffins every day to working professionals seeking home-style vegetarian meals. Our kitchen continues to follow the same principles of fresh, wholesome cooking that began with those first few customers. Lunch is delivered between 12:00 and 1:00 pm.

